{"id":"9b156726c5da6a79","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-rdpartition.md","title":"Recessive-dominant partitions of consensus-closed term families","display":"df-rdpartition — Recessive-dominant partitions of consensus-closed term families","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-rdpartition","aliases":["27-df-rdpartition"],"display":"df-rdpartition — Recessive-dominant partitions of consensus-closed term families","depends_on":["[[27-df-consensusclosure]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§6.6 Definition 6.8","source_statement":"Recessive-dominant partitions of consensus-closed term families","source_printed_pages":"293","source_pdf_pages":"317","verification_status":"source-definition-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-rdpartition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-rdpartition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-rdpartition — Recessive-dominant partitions of consensus-closed term families"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7d5c58a3a73488b3\" href=\"?note=7d5c58a3a73488b3\" title=\"27-df-consensusclosure\">27-df-consensusclosure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§6.6 Definition 6.8"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9b156726c5da6a79\" href=\"?note=9b156726c5da6a79\" title=\"Recessive-dominant partitions of consensus-closed term families\">Recessive-dominant partitions of consensus-closed term families</a>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"293"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"317"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,R,D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Term}_n\">\\(U,R,D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Term}_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QCl}\">\\(\\mathrm{QCl}\\)</span> 和部分运算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConsTerm}\">\\(\\mathrm{ConsTerm}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7d5c58a3a73488b3\" href=\"?note=7d5c58a3a73488b3\" title=\"27-df-consensusclosure\">27-df-consensusclosure</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RD}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{RD}_n\\)</span> 是本节引入的三元项族谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RD}_n(U;R,D)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ U=R\\cup D\\land R\\cap D=\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{QCl}(U)=U\\land\\mathrm{QCl}(R)=R\\land\\mathrm{QCl}(D)=D\\land\\forall(T,V)\\in(R\\times D)\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{ConsTerm})\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ConsTerm}(T,V)\\in D\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{RD}_n(U;R,D)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ U=R\\cup D\\land R\\cap D=\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{QCl}(U)=U\\land\\mathrm{QCl}(R)=R\\land\\mathrm{QCl}(D)=D\\land\\forall(T,V)\\in(R\\times D)\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{ConsTerm})\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ConsTerm}(T,V)\\in D\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是不作 absorption 的项族分区：混合来源的 consensus 继承 dominant 部分。QCl 与本书第6章的 term-set consensus closure 接口一致。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-consensusclosure","status":"resolved","id":"7d5c58a3a73488b3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-consensusclosure]]","embed":false},{"target":"Recessive-dominant partitions of consensus-closed term families","status":"resolved","id":"9b156726c5da6a79","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · source_statement","heading":"","excerpt":"[[Recessive-dominant partitions of consensus-closed term families]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-consensusclosure","status":"resolved","id":"7d5c58a3a73488b3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$U,R,D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Term}_n$；$\\mathrm{QCl}$ 和部分运算 $\\mathrm{ConsTerm}$ 见 [[27-df-consensusclosure]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"U,R,D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Term}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QCl}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConsTerm}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RD}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RD}_n(U;R,D)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ U=R\\cup D\\land R\\cap D=\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{QCl}(U)=U\\land\\mathrm{QCl}(R)=R\\land\\mathrm{QCl}(D)=D\\land\\forall(T,V)\\in(R\\times D)\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{ConsTerm})\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ConsTerm}(T,V)\\in D\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1476,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-55","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-df-rdpartition|df-rdpartition — Recessive-dominant partitions of consensus-closed term families]]"},{"id":"8f5ab08dd390d871","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$。$h\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$，$U=\\mathrm{QCl}(\\mathrm{PI}(h))$，$\\mathrm{RD}_n(U;R,D)$；见 [[27-df-hornfunc]]、[[27-df-piset]]、[[27-df-rdpartition]]。$\\eta\\subseteq U$ 且 $\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(\\eta)=h$。"}],"outgoing":["7d5c58a3a73488b3"]}